	quest.04A614034EC5343A.quest_desc: [
		"While equipped, the glyph of this school will be amplified and discounted."
		""
		"As a drawback, the lesser focus will weaken glyphs of other elemental schools."
		""
		"This focus empowers &bFreeze&r, adding &3Freezing&r buildup to the target and eventually &3Frozen&r for a short time, stopping the target from healing."
		""
		"&bConjure Water&r + &bFreeze&r combo to conjure Ice."
		""
		"&aSummon Steed&r will be changed to summon a rideable &bDolphin&r."
