	quest.0EDAFC8030FBBD50.quest_desc: [
		"Without augments, &dRitual of Summon Wilden&r will summon a random variety of &cWilden&r monsters for a short duration."
		""
		"When augmented with a &aWilden Spike&r, &aWilden Horn&r, and a &aWilden Wing&r, this ritual will summon the &6Wilden Chimera&r, a challenging and destructive monster."
		""
		"&nWarning:&r If summoning the chimera, this ritual will destroy blocks around the brazier."
	]
