		""
		"&dCaptain's&r will hold a banner matching their &aConfig Card&r color."
		""
		"Each color can only have 1 &dCaptain&r."
		""
		"Golems can be set to \"Follow Captain\" with a command wand or \"Squad\" with a &aConfig Card&r."
		""
		"&c&nNote:&r&r A &dCaptain&r set to \"Follow Captain\" will just stand in place."
	]
	quest.11C1D6036D7DFD43.quest_desc: [
