	quest.140F729DBE30C642.quest_subtitle: "Faster Mana"
	quest.1410B1976ED2E09C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Locator Orbs&r give your &aDTN Dog&r a colorful accessory which can be toggled in the style menu."
		""
		"The color of the &6Locator Orb&r also changes the text color of the &aDTN Dog's&r name while using the &dCanine Tracker&r. "
	]
	quest.141C285B6E85F6B0.quest_subtitle: "Use in the Augmenting Table to change or enhance an item's affix"
	quest.14260F1A141EFC11.quest_subtitle: "Ice Mage"
	quest.14260F1A141EFC11.title: "Mountain Tower"
	quest.145F812F374CF227.quest_subtitle: "Found in Priest Towers"
	quest.14A1E13EBB9501A1.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Greybeard Staff&r is the easiest staff to craft. It provides a nice boost to mana and mana regeneration for aspiring wizards."
		""
		"Holding a staff allows you to cast a spell by Right-Clicking instead of using Iron's Spells 'Cast' keybind."
	]
	quest.14A1E13EBB9501A1.quest_subtitle: "It's just a big wand"
	quest.1502A4070F0B9D54.title: "Max Spawn Delay"
	quest.1518E53B37EEC82E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Magnifying Bone&r makes your &aDTN Dog&r larger!"
		""
		"&dShrinking Mallet&r makes your &aDTN Dog&r smaller!"
	]
	quest.1518E53B37EEC82E.title: "One makes you larger / One makes you smaller"
	quest.1525DC69F847C4D2.quest_subtitle: "Join our Discord and let me know what you think should be in the shop"
	quest.15A2CE894BD843C0.quest_desc: ["obtained by a &bSniffer&r, can be fed to your familiars to get &dMemory Fragments&r."]
	quest.15CC8FF1887B68A6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Golem Weapons&r come in three types; &aSwords&r, &bAxes&r, and &dSpears&r."
		""
		"&aSwords&r: Add +1 Interaction Range and +2 Sweep Range"
		""
		"&bAxes&r: Increase Damage by a percentage and +2 Sweep Range"
		""
		"&dSpears&r: Add +2 Interaction Range"
	]
	quest.15E5F1B290A6F4A6.quest_desc: [
		"&dSource Relay: Collector&r will suck up any available &9Source&r up to 5 blocks away and send it to 1 target block set with a &eDominion Wand&r."
		""
		"You can use a &eDominion Wand&r to prevent the &dSource Relay: Collector&r from taking &9Source&r from a nearby block by setting the &dSource Relay: Collector&r to 'Take' from the block you don't want it to take &9Source&r from. Counter intuitive, I know."
		"&dThe Source Relay: Collector&r will take &9Source&r from every available block without linking any 'Take' blocks, so think of it more as blacklisted or 'Dont Take'."
	]
	quest.15E5F1B290A6F4A6.quest_subtitle: "Source Vacuum"
	quest.163B50B0A02D0D9E.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Compass&r will point towards your spawn point."
		""
		"Did you know, Right-Clicking a &dLoadstone&r with a &6Compass&r will set the &dLoadstone&r as the new target? "
		""
		"Renaming the &6Compass&r can help you keep track of where it points."
	]
	quest.163B50B0A02D0D9E.title: "Intro to Adventure"
	quest.166F417BE0B43A54.title: "Ignore Light"
	quest.1670ADD94865145C.quest_desc: [
		"&dAmethyst Golems&r will harvest, grow, and collect &5Amethyst&r near its home."
		""
		"To obtain an &dAmethyst Golem&r, perform the &bRitual of Awakening&r near &5Budding Amethyst&r to obtain the &aAmethyst Golem Charm&r."
		""
		"&nSummoning:&r"
		""
		"Summon the &dAmethyst Golem&r by using a charm on a block."
		""
		"Before an &dAmethyst Golem&r will perform tasks, they must first have a home. "
		""
		"Set their home by using the &6Dominion Wand&r on the golem, and then on a block."
		""
		"The golem's home is considered to be 10 blocks in any direction from the set position."
		""
		"&nFarming Amethyst:&r"
		""
		"Once a home has been set, the &dAmethyst Golem&r will begin performing tasks over time."
		""
		"They will convert &5Amethyst Blocks&r into &5Budding Amethyst&r, harvest &aAmethyst Clusters&r, speed up &5Budding Amethyst&r growth, and pick-up and store &aAmethyst Shards&r."
		""
		"&nStoring Amethyst:&r"
		""
		"If an &5Amethyst Golem's&r home has been set to an inventory, the golem will pick-up and store &aAmethyst Shards&r in their bound inventory block."
		""
		"If their home is not an inventory, they will ignore items on the ground."
	]
	quest.1670ADD94865145C.quest_subtitle: "Amethyst Harvester"
	quest.16BD008FC4F37587.quest_desc: ["&dPotion Flask: Amplify&r increases the pwer of the potion by 1 level, but reduces the duration by 50%"]
	quest.16BD008FC4F37587.quest_subtitle: "Stronger Potions"
	quest.16BE79AFC8375CFC.quest_subtitle: "Found in Impaled Shipwrecks"
	quest.16D5A4C5BF4DD6D4.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to the &6BeetleKnight's Beyond&r! Whether you stumbled across this or sought it out, &dThank You&r for giving it a shot. "
		""
		"This started as a personal project and grew into something we're really proud of. We hope you enjoy the journey. There's a lot to discover, and some seriously tough fights ahead."
		""
		"Good luck, and don't die too much."
		""
		"&6Beyond&r is still a work in progress but updates are released frequently so make sure you're up to date!"
	]
	quest.16D5A4C5BF4DD6D4.quest_subtitle: "Have a backpack, you've earned it!"
	quest.16D5A4C5BF4DD6D4.title: "Thanks For Playing"
	quest.1763DFF17242032E.quest_desc: [
		"You can get a &dDrygmy Token&r by throwing a &aWilden Horn&r near a wild &6Drygmy&r!"
		""
		"&nSummoning:&r"
		""
		"To summon a &6Drygmy&r, use a &dDrymy Charm&r on a block of &aMossy Cobblestone&r."
		"The cobblestone will transform into a Drygmy Henge and summon your Drgymy! "
		""
		"To summon additional &6Drygmys&r, use more charms on the henge. Casting &bDispel&r or killing the &6Drygmy&r will return your charm."
		""
		"&nHappiness:&r"
		""
		"A &6Drygmy&r considers its home to be 10 blocks in every direction from its henge. The &6Drygmy&r will use this area to produce items from any entities nearby."
		""
		"Your &6Drgymy's&r efficiency is dependent on its happiness. This may be increased for each entity nearby, with a bonus for each unique type near its home."
		""
		"Nearby &eContainment Jars&r will also count as an entity."
		""
		"&nProduction:&r"
		""
		"Each &6Drygmy&r working around a henge contributes progress."
		""
		"Once maximum progress has been reached, the henge will generate items and experience gems and deposit them into adjacent chests. Each time this occurs, the henge will require &9Source&r to recharge. "
		""
		"The number of drops and experience gems is equal to the &6Drygmy&r happiness and experience value of the entities. "
		""
		"To get started, place a &eChest&r and &9Jar of Source&r next to the Henge."
		""
		""
		"You may dye a Drygmy &bCyan&r, &6Orange&r, or Brown."
	]
	quest.1763DFF17242032E.quest_subtitle: "Mob Farmer"
	quest.17736D3A90061EF3.quest_desc: [
		"Increased &bSpell Damage&r for &dWater Spells&r."
		""
		"Attacks inflict &bFreeze&r, and the wearer gets a speed boost in rain and water."
	]
	quest.1787F9696002361E.title: "Sophisticated Backpacks"
	quest.179E26752022BA91.title: "Generating SU"
	quest.17C5672B62F2D200.quest_subtitle: "Spawned mobs drop more loot"
	quest.17C5672B62F2D200.title: "Echoing"
	quest.17DA2DCA627C0158.quest_subtitle: "Found in Archmage Laboratory"
	quest.181DEDB4B8F2BAF7.quest_subtitle: "Adds 1 socket to an item (Once per item, Max 3 sockets)"
	quest.182160EA19A13D48.quest_subtitle: "17 Armor"
	quest.182160EA19A13D48.title: "Bone Reptile Armor"
	quest.1884056F9269E4D2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Lingering Flask Cannon&r can consume potions from bottles and flasks from the players inventory and convert the potion into a &bLingering Potion&r. "
		""
		"To select the potion to be thrown, use the Radial Menu to select your flask or potion and use the launcher."
	]
	quest.18975CFF39235A3C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Flux Networks&r gives you access to very powerful wireless energy storage."
		""
		"To start you need &dFlux Dust&r."
		""
		"To make your first &dFlux Dust&r you have to drop &cRedstone&r on &bBedrock&r and crush it by Left-Clicking an &9Obsidian&r block placed above it."
		""
		"A &eFlux Block&r can be used in place of &bBedrock&r once you have made enough &dFlux Dust&r"
	]
	quest.18975CFF39235A3C.title: "Flux Networks"
	quest.18992D366D330583.quest_desc: [
		"&6Storage Terminals&r allows access to the entire &eStorage Network&r from a single block. "
		""
		"Just slap a &6Storage Terminal&r on an &aInventory Cable&r and that's it."
	]
	quest.18C71A40D788651E.quest_desc: [
		"Use &9Mana&r to get an extra jump. "
		"It's basicaly free flight, but you may look a little goofy."
		""
		"Now you can retire that old Water Bucket you use to break your falls."
	]
	quest.18C71A40D788651E.quest_subtitle: "Double Jump? Triple? Quinseptuagintuple?"
	quest.18DFED8F280690B7.title: "The Barbarian"
	quest.18F8FA80E0E8EA9E.quest_subtitle: "Found in Ancient Cities"
	quest.191FE55B3CA39FF1.title: "Random Tier 2 Chicken"
	quest.19325D0977226030.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Omnipotent Wand&r combines all other wands into one."
		""
		"While holding the &6Omnipotent Wand&r, hold Shift and scroll with the Mouse Wheel to change the active wand."
		""
		"&cNote:&r A &dTouhou Little Maid&r with job set to &eGolem&r holding an &6Omnipotent Wand&r will summon every golem in their inventory to defend their owner."
	]
	quest.19AD8E5742348837.title: "Tier 4"
	quest.19FE0A058CE6E55F.title: "Find Origin Island"
	quest.1AD02FFF30C8D2F5.quest_desc: ["Nickel and copper — the bread and butter of Oritech. Gather these and you’re officially in the club."]
	quest.1AD02FFF30C8D2F5.quest_subtitle: "Find basic metals Oritech relies on."
	quest.1AD02FFF30C8D2F5.title: "Metal Starter Pack"
	quest.1AFFB729F9463546.quest_desc: [
		"&6Basic Inventory Hopper&r is a simple &aImport&r/&cExport&r solution for a &dStorage Network&r."
		""
		"The &6Basic Inventory Hopper&r can be connected on the top or bottom side of the block. &bInventory Cables&r will not connect to the sides of the hopper."
		""
		"Right-clicking the &6Basic Inventory Hopper&r with an item in your hand will set that item as the filtered item. &aItem Filters&r can also be used to filter multiple items."
	]
	quest.1B2C271C4D31E613.quest_desc: [
		"&dPotion Flask&r stores 8 charges of a potion."
		""
		"To fill the flask, use the flask on a &bPotion Jar&r, or combine the flask with a potion in a crafting grid."
		""
		"You may empty the &dPotion Flask&r by using the flask on a &bPotion Jar&r while sneaking."
	]
	quest.1B2C271C4D31E613.quest_subtitle: "Reusable Potion Bottle"
	quest.1B5949F034F63681.quest_subtitle: "7 Armor"
	quest.1B5949F034F63681.title: "Leather Armor"
	quest.1B9E1FE9D2E26A86.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crafting Terminal&r is the same as the &aStorage Terminal&r except it adds a crafting grid."
		""
		"The &6Crafting Terminal&r will automatically fill recipes with materials from the &eStorage Network&r."
	]
	quest.1BA4FE7F07DD942E.quest_desc: ["&6Flux Configurator&r can copy and paste transfer limits and priority."]
	quest.1C9EF4F5DCC43E2D.title: "The Ancient City"
	quest.1CEAFACED815E0C6.title: "Prefab Tier 1"
	quest.1CF4ED1296808564.quest_subtitle: "Spawns a baby version of the mob if possible"
	quest.1CF4ED1296808564.title: "Youthful"
	quest.1D0891BB01FFDC99.quest_desc: [
		"&l&6Crafting On A Stick&r&r"
		"A portable version of many functional blocks!"
		""
		"There is also a &eCurio&r slot for &6Crafting On A Stick&r, which can be accessed with a keybind. "
		""
		"(Default keybind is \"V\")"
	]
	quest.1D0891BB01FFDC99.quest_subtitle: "Portable Crafting"
	quest.1D0891BB01FFDC99.title: "Crafting On A Stick"
	quest.1D92E432D684EFF3.quest_desc: [
		"A &dRitual Brazier&r that may be used as decoration or for performing rituals."
		""
		"To light the brazier for decoration, cast a &bLight&r spell on the brazier. The color of the brazier corresponds with the color of the spell."
		""
		"Applying a redstone signal will disable a running ritual."
		""
		"&nPerforming Rituals:&r"
		""
		"Performing a ritual requires a &dRitual Brazier&r, and a tablet. "
		""
		"Once you have obtained a tablet and brazier, place your brazier in the world and use a tablet on it. The brazier will ignite, and await activation."
		""
		"In this state, you may throw in any additional items as a way to augment the ritual. If you wish to augment a ritual, simply toss the item on top of the brazier."
		""
		"To activate your ritual, interact with the brazier with an empty hand."
		""
		"Once activated, your ritual can no longer be augmented and will be consumed."
		""
		"If a ritual requires &9Source&r to operate, the brazier will pull from &9Source Jars&r within 6 blocks."
	]
	quest.1D9E1AEE17F71145.quest_desc: [
		"&6Jar of Voiding&r can destroy items on pickup and grants a small amount of mana in return."
		""
		"To turn the jar on and off, use the jar while sneaking. "
		""
		"To add or remove an item to be destroyed by the jar, use the jar with an item in the off hand, or use an item on the &dScribe's Table&r with the jar placed on it."
		""
		"The jar must be in your hotbar to function."
	]
	quest.1D9E1AEE17F71145.quest_subtitle: "Trash into Mana"
	quest.1DA28C1B49A6C206.quest_desc: [
		"&3Sirens&r are usually found near coral formations, jumping out of the water or following boats."
		""
		"You can get a &aSiren Token&r by giving them a &bSea Pickle&r."
		""
		"&nSummoning:&r"
		""
		"The &dSiren Charm&r can be used to summon a &3Siren&r and if used on &ePrismarine&r it will transform into a &6Siren Shrine&r."
		""
		"&nProduction:&r"
		""
		"The Shrine will slowly generate fishing loot over time. Each time this occurs, the shrine will require &9Source&r."
		""
		"The number of items and chance of getting a treasure will increase if many different water animals and plants are near the shrine."
		""
		"Tamed &3Sirens&r can change colors if you give them kelp or corals."
	]
	quest.1DA28C1B49A6C206.quest_subtitle: "Auto-Fishing"
	quest.1DC7DFAECF4C0C2B.title: "The Bard"
	quest.1DD3B4EA15B3F453.quest_desc: [
		"Increased &bSpell Damage&r for &dAnima Spells&r."
		""
		"The wearer's attacks randomly &eHeal&r or &8Wither&r the target and give the user a small health boost"
	]
	quest.1DF32908BF4764C9.title: "Netherite-Diamond Armor"
	quest.1E2ABE37590C8EFE.quest_subtitle: "20 Armor"
	quest.1E2ABE37590C8EFE.title: "Eclipse Alloy Armor"
	quest.1E47F29B61AB1627.quest_subtitle: "Infuse Copper with Redstone"
	quest.1E503A91F3B3F5C9.quest_desc: [
		"The &eImbument Chamber&r can create &9Source Gems&r and &9Source Gem Blocks&r out of &1Lapis&r, &dAmethyst&r, and &dAmethyst Blocks&r."
		""
		"The &eImbument Chamber&r is also used to create &aElemental Essence&r, which are used as crafting materials for the more advanced recipes."
		""
		"Place the required items on &ePedestals&r adjacent to the &eImbument Chamber&r, these items will not be consumed during the crafting process."
		""
		"The &eImbument Chamber&r does not require any fuel to function, however it can use &9Source&r to speed up the process."
		"{image:kubejs:item/ars_imbument1 width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.1E5E4C3CAC0DD59D.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.1E5E4C3CAC0DD59D.title: "Just Another Mining Dimension (Overworld)"
	quest.1E8FA47B254E510E.title: "+1 Charm Slot"
	quest.1EC6859EAE5223D3.title: "Buzzing Briefcase"
	quest.1EE0B4B44BF1011E.title: "The Rogue"
	quest.1F5E468F1CE29CBA.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.1F5E468F1CE29CBA.quest_subtitle: "You will need a lot of these"
	quest.1F5EA63B00347B1C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Lightning Mage Familiar&r"
		""
		"&bBattle:&r specialized in lightning magic, casting spells that hit multiple targets at the same time."
		""
		"&bAbilities:&r"
		"&aCharge Owner:&r has the ability to charge the owner for some time, giving them increased speed and strength."
		"&aCharge Creeper:&r every time they find a creeper, they will follow them to charge it."
		""
		"&bSpawn:&r can be found wandering around in mountains, searching for a good spot to attract lightnings."
		""
		"&bFood:&r can be healed using lightning bottles."
	]
	quest.1F5EA63B00347B1C.title: "Tame a Lightning Mage"
	quest.1F7CD67FC8D86D13.title: "Tutorial Complete!"
	quest.1FCA5C05805FE5AE.title: "Roost Ultimate"
	quest.206F74D33B326D2D.quest_subtitle: "More Mana"
	quest.207412235FCFE1DE.title: "Min Spawn Delay"
	quest.2088DD7260775846.quest_desc: [
		"Increased &bSpell Damage&r for &dEarth Spells&r."
		""
		"Attacks inflict &bSnare&r, and the wearer gets immunity to cactus and berry bushes, and knockback resistance."
	]
	quest.20C51F31255186D4.quest_subtitle: "Archevoker"
	quest.20C51F31255186D4.title: "Evoker Fort"
	quest.20C715FF95E89506.quest_desc: [
		"Provides a list of items to automation related entities. "
		""
		"To inscribe an item, place on the &bScribes Table&r and use blocks and items on the table while sneaking."
		""
		"When given to a &aStarbuncle&r, the &aStarbuncle&r will pickup and take any item that is NOT on this scroll."
	]
	quest.20C715FF95E89506.quest_subtitle: "Blacklist Filter"
	quest.2109877D92DF9E65.quest_subtitle: "Punch a Tree"
	quest.2109877D92DF9E65.title: "Get Wood"
	quest.2274D0F3F7C7ADB0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Replication&r allows you to break down items into their base forms of matter and reshape them into other items."
		""
		"To start, you will need to find &aReplica Ore&r in the deepslate layer and smelted into &bReplica Ingots&r."
	]
	quest.2274D0F3F7C7ADB0.title: "Replication"
	quest.22EACD04220FA3FD.quest_subtitle: "Found in Jungle Temples"
	quest.2351A891CBD3856C.quest_desc: ["The &6Summon Wand&r allows you to summon the first golem in your inventory wherever you point or summon all golems at once where you stand."]
	quest.23B90F1FD6FE8FAF.quest_desc: [
		"Your &6Dog Golem&r is ready to serve!"
		""
		"&6Dog Golems&r are limited to &aWolf Armor&r, but they make up for it in utility. &6Dog Golems&r can carry other golems on their back."
		""
		"&9Players&r can ride a &6Dog Golem&r with the use of a &bRider Wand&r."
		""
		"&c&nNote:&r&r The &dSize-Up Upgrade&r increases the number of passengers a &6Dog Golems&r can hold."
		""
		"Base Dog Golem-"
		"1 Humanoid Golem/Player"
		""
		"1x Size-Up Upgrade-"
		"2 Humanoid Golem/Player or 1 Metal Golem"
		""
		"2x Size-Up Upgrade-"
		"3 Humanoid Golem/Player or 1 Metal Golem"
	]
	quest.23B90F1FD6FE8FAF.title: "Craft a Dog Golem"
	quest.23C8893DFAFD60A1.title: "+1 Hand Slot"
	quest.2438A4940922891E.quest_subtitle: "Luck"
	quest.2438A4940922891E.title: "Shaper"
	quest.245A828A5B8B0930.quest_subtitle: "7 Armor"
	quest.245A828A5B8B0930.title: "Wood Armor"
	quest.24D77E54F46341CD.quest_subtitle: "37 Armor"
	quest.24D77E54F46341CD.title: "Tyr Armor"
	quest.2555CE61DF4A539E.quest_subtitle: "A Good Deal"
	quest.256EB066CE77FA9C.quest_subtitle: "Use in the Reforging Table with a rarity material to give an item an affix"
	quest.257301489C197D7A.quest_desc: ["The &6Inscriber&r is used to inscribe &aCircuits&r and &bProcessors&r using the presses found in the &dMysterious Cube&r, and to crush various items into dust."]
	quest.257CCA9EBB05A837.quest_desc: [
		"&dSource Relay: Splitter&r can take from multiple targets and send to multiple targets."
		""
		"It distributes &9Source&r evenly and has increased throughput compared to other relays to support high volumn transfers."
	]
	quest.257CCA9EBB05A837.quest_subtitle: "Source Super Highway"
	quest.257E64CD433C53A4.quest_subtitle: "Converts Iron Furnaces to Smokers"
	quest.259082A53D599961.quest_desc: [
		"A pair of &dSource Relay: Warpers&r can transfer &9Source&r beyond the normal limit of 30 blocks."
		""
		"&cWarning:&r The greater the distance beyond 30 blocks the more &9Source&r is lost in transfer."
		""
		"From 90 blocks away, A full &9Source Jar&r only lost 13% in transfer, so don't be afraid to test the limits for long range &9Source&r transfers."
	]
	quest.259082A53D599961.quest_subtitle: "Long Distance Source"
	quest.25CDBBE0626A1A5B.title: "Energy Upgrade"
	quest.25DD29B6CCB8D3F8.quest_desc: [
		"You can challenge your &6Little Maid&r to &aBoard Games&r to increase &#FF7FDFFavorability&r."
		""
		"After winning a few games, &6Little Maids&r will increase their &cdifficulty&r."
	]
	quest.25DD29B6CCB8D3F8.title: "Little Games for Little Maids"
	quest.269BDDC23518274C.quest_subtitle: "Increase your /sethome limit to 3"
	quest.269BDDC23518274C.title: "Home Limit Upgrade 2"
	quest.26DE77C0248BEA40.title: "The Cleric"
	quest.2706FC19EED9689F.title: "The Aritificer"
	quest.27B4BB76553CD1EC.quest_subtitle: "Silk Touch a spawner to pick it up"
	quest.27B4BB76553CD1EC.title: "Apothic Spawners"
	quest.27C60A25005B964D.quest_desc: ["&6Master Treats&r can level your &aDTN Dog&r up to level &c60&r!"]
	quest.27CC2706D47211DA.quest_desc: ["Your first gem dust can be aquired by crushing apotheosis gems with a falling anvil"]
	quest.27CC2706D47211DA.quest_subtitle: "Crush Some Gems"
	quest.282E29BA337B9444.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you have all of the basic materials and machines for AE2, you can make your first ME System!"
		""
		"This will be a very basic one, no autocrafting, no logistics, just nice, simple, searchable storage."
		""
		"You will need:"
		"&bME Drive&r - Stores up to 10 Storage Disks"
		""
		"&eME Terminal&r - Allows the player to move items in/out of Disk Drives connected to the ME System"
		""
		"&6Energy Acceptor&r - Powers your ME System with any prefered method of generating FE"
		""
		"&dFluix ME Glass Cable&r - Connects the devices of your ME System and transfers power"
	]
	quest.282E29BA337B9444.title: "Your First ME System"
	quest.283B02EC81235E0E.quest_subtitle: "Health Boost"
	quest.283B02EC81235E0E.title: "Silence"
	quest.287AED27BD0FE27F.quest_desc: [
		"The &dFlarecannon&r can be used as a wandering sentry."
		""
		"It will cast &cFlare Homing Projectiles&r at enemies and patrol around the area assigned using the &6Dominion Wand&r."
		""
		"&bSoul Sand&r and &cMagma Blocks&r can be used to change the appearance."
		""
		"If defeated, it can be reactivated with &aBlaze Powder&r or &aMagma Cream&r."
	]
	quest.287AED27BD0FE27F.quest_subtitle: "Fire Guard"
	quest.28BC9669A6F30D52.title: "+2 Curio Slots"
	quest.292245CECC56454B.title: "Celestigem Armor"
	quest.293447E0026323C4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Inventory Connector&r is the foundation of &dTom's Simple Storage&r."
		""
		"Place the &6Inventory Connector&r next to an inventory and it will connect all adjacent inventories."
		""
		"The &6Inventory Connector&r by itself can show you useful information such as how many available slots are in your &eStorage Network&r, but you will need a &aStorage Terminal&r if you want to access that network from a single block."
	]
	quest.293447E0026323C4.title: "Tom's Simple Storage"
	quest.29D5F443F0D643B0.quest_subtitle: "Ignores all spawn conditions; light, biome, etc."
	quest.29D5F443F0D643B0.title: "Ignore All Conditions"
	quest.2A2BDB50B0B804C3.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Wixie&r can automatically craft items and potions for you at the expense of source. "
		""
		"To obtain a &aWixie Token&r, cast &bDispel&r on a &cWitch&r while it is half health or less."
		""
		"Once you have obtained a &aWixie Charm&r, use it on a &eCauldron&r to summon your &6Wixie&r."
		""
		"A &6Wixie&r can be dyed &4Red&r, White, &0Black&r, &1Blue&r, or &2Green&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&nItem Crafting:&r"
		""
		"The &6Wixie&r will select the recipe for crafting based on the inventories nearby, you don't need to specify the exact materials for the recipe. "
		""
		"For example, if you want to craft &aSticks&r, the &6Wixie&r will mix and match planks from nearby chests in order to fulfill the recipe. "
		""
		"Each craft requires a small amount of &9Source&r and will be drained from nearby &9Source Jars&r. A redstone signal on the &eCauldron&r will stop crafting."
		""
		"&nMulti-Item Crafting:&r"
		""
		"&6Wixies&r can craft multiple items at once by placing &bArcane Pedestals&r adjacent to the cauldron."
		""
		"&6Wixie's&r will attempt to craft items in the &bArcane Pedestals&r, rotating round robin."
		""
		"Powering an &bArcane Pedestals&r with redstone signal will disable the wixie from crafting its item."
		""
		"&nBinding Inventories:&r"
		""
		"You can select specific inventories for the &6Wixie&r by using a &dDominion Wand&r on an inventory, and then the &eCauldron&r."
		""
		"If any inventories are selected, only these inventories can be used and the &6Wixie&r will no longer pull from all nearby inventories."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&nPotion Crafting:&r"
		""
		"&6Wixie&r will autocraft potions using nearby &5Potion Jars&r and items."
		""
		"&ePotions&r that require &3Water&r will be supplied by the &6Wixie&r."
		""
		"&ePotions&r that require another potion as a base will be taken from nearby &5Potion Jars&r. A &6Wixie&r will output 3 doses of a &ePotion&r into a nearby &5Potion Jar&r when complete."
		""
		"To begin, place down an empty &5Potion Jar&r, right-click the &eCauldron&r with an &bAwkward Potion&r, and supply &cNether Wart&r from a nearby chest."
		""
		"When using multiple &6Wixies&r, you may wish to lock a jar to a specific &ePotion&r."
		""
		"&6Wixies&r will only output potion to jars that contain the same potion, or unlocked empty &5Potion Jars&r."
	]
	quest.2A2BDB50B0B804C3.quest_subtitle: "Auto-Craft"
	quest.2A500E67CE60B3D6.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Level Emitter&r is a useful block that will send a redstone signal when an item reaches a specified value."
		""
		"Interacting with the &6Level Emitter&r will open the GUI that allows a player to insert an item and choose &a> (greater than)&r or &c< (less than)&r the specified value."
	]
	quest.2A76012CDA1B4F71.quest_desc: [
		"&dArcane Armor&r will increase the wearers &bMax Mana&r, &bMana Regen&r and can be upgraded with special abilities using &aThreads&r."
		""
		"The &nSorceror's&r set provides the lowest defence, but provides the most powerful set of slots for Threads."
		""
		"The &nArcanist's&r and&n Battlemage's&r sets provide increasingly more defence, but fewer and less powerful &aThread Slots&r."
		""
		"&nThread Slots:&r"
		""
		"Each type of armor has its own unique set of &aThread Slots&r."
		""
		"Upgrading the armor to a new tier will unlock additional slots to the armor. "
	]
	quest.2A76012CDA1B4F71.title: "Arcane Armor"
	quest.2AFBFD7B9A51C8C3.title: "Pinnacle"
	quest.2B0BC257DC311DA8.quest_subtitle: "31 Armor"
	quest.2B0BC257DC311DA8.title: "Refined Obsidian Armor"
	quest.2B0C121705D1DDA4.quest_desc: ["The &6Rider Wand&r allows the player to ride a &dDog Golem&r"]
	quest.2B2CF5C38535DD9C.title: "+3 Curio Slots"
	quest.2B84BC0EFAD472EB.quest_subtitle: "900% Faster!!!"
	quest.2BA61A5CE5D88B34.quest_desc: [
		"&3Alakarkinos&r can sift &aSand&r and &aGravel&r to find items found in archaeology sites. "
		""
		"They can be found on beaches and will give you a token if they receive a &6Poterry Sherd&r of any kind."
		""
		""
		"&nSummoning:&r"
		""
		"&3Alakarkinos&r can be summoned anywhere by using a charm on a block."
		""
		"To set its home, use the &6Dominion Wand&r to bind &3Alakarkinos&r to a &eChest&r or inventory."
		""
		"&nSifting:&r"
		""
		"&3Alakarkinos&r will seek out &aGravel&r or &aSand&r that is placed within 3 blocks horizontal and one block vertical around it bound inventory."
		""
		"In order to convert blocks into items, &9Source&r must be provided near its &eChest&r."
		""
		"After some time and a few magic tricks, &3Alakarkinos&r will destroy the &aSand&r or &aGravel&r and insert items into the inventory"
	]
	quest.2BA61A5CE5D88B34.quest_subtitle: "Auto-Sifting"
	quest.2C02958905FD3B2F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Scorcher Familiar&r"
		""
		"&bBattle:&r specialized in fire magic, burning their enemies to death."
		""
		"&bAbilities:&r"
		"&aMolten Heart:&r upon getting hit, they will set attackers on fire for some time."
		"&aHeatproof:&r grants their owner and themself fire immunity."
		""
		"&bSpawn:&r can be found wandering around in hot places in the nether."
		""
		"&bFood:&r can be healed using blaze powder."
	]
	quest.2C02958905FD3B2F.title: "Tame a Scorcher"
	quest.2C5375F4E5625EA6.quest_subtitle: "Strength"
	quest.2C5375F4E5625EA6.title: "Spire"
	quest.2C55700673CF525E.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Enchanter's Crossbow&r will cast the inscribed spell as a &dSpell Arrow&r if the player has enough mana."
		""
		"If no arrows are in the inventory, a &dSpell Arrow&r that deals 0 damage will be cast."
		""
		"If the player does not have enough mana, an &eArrow&r will be shot instead."
		""
		"&6Enchanter's Crossbow&r may use special &bAugment Arrows&r for empowering the inscribed spell."
		""
		"When inscribing a spell, do not give the spell a form it will be added automatically."
	]
	quest.2C5D34CEDDA666C9.quest_desc: [
		"By itself the &dScry Crystal&r doesn't do much, but combined with an &6Enchanter's Eye&r or &9Scryer's Oculus&r you get unique functionality."
		""
		"Linked with an &6Enchanter's Eye&r allows you to cast the inscribed spell remotely."
		""
		"Create a linked &eScryer's Scroll&r by right-clicking the &dScry Crystal&r with a &eBlank Parchment&r, and place that scroll on an &9Arcane Pedestal&r near a &9Scryer's Oculus&r and you can look through the &dScry Crystal&r like a security camera."
	]
	quest.2C5D34CEDDA666C9.quest_subtitle: "Magic Security Camera"
	quest.2D796DBC25ECDB19.quest_subtitle: "Combine matching gems to create a gem of higher rarity"
	quest.2DCD0239AA950F05.quest_subtitle: "The most useful modifier, turns those mobs brain-dead"
	quest.2DCD0239AA950F05.title: "No AI"
	quest.2DD4FFBDDD93DAB2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Powah&r adds many methods of generating FE"
		""
		"The foundation of &6Powah&r is &aDielectric Paste&r"
		"You will need a bunch of this moving forward"
	]
	quest.2DD4FFBDDD93DAB2.title: "Powah"
	quest.2E2B14C1A13C78DF.title: "Tier 5"
	quest.2E2B39E520D9BF4F.quest_desc: [
		"While equipped, &3Focus of Water&r grants &bAmplify&r and discounts the casting cost for glyphs of this school."
		""
		"&3Focus of Water&r also grants &bMana Regen I&r while the wearer is wet or &bMana Regen II&r and &bDolphin's Grace&r while swimming."
		""
		"Unlike a lesser focus, a major focus will not weaken glyphs of other elemental schools."
	]
	quest.2E2FC5A0FDA67270.quest_desc: [
		"When you think of storage mods you probably think &bAE2&r, &6Refined Storage&r, &eTom's Simple Storage&r, etc. "
		""
		"Did you know &dArs Nouveau&r can give you a highly effecient, cross-dimensional, cost free, wireless storage network?"
		""
		"You might not think of &dArs Nouveau&r when planning a big storage network, but I hope these quest can inspire you try it out."
	]
	quest.2E2FC5A0FDA67270.quest_subtitle: "Magic's Best Storage Solution"
	quest.2E2FC5A0FDA67270.title: "Ars Storage Network"
	quest.2E34D1024948F737.quest_subtitle: "14 Armor"
	quest.2E34D1024948F737.title: "Slime Armor (Immersive Armors)"
	quest.2E5A3AA27BBA6FA9.quest_desc: ["&6Scarecrow Armor&r is superior to the &bWandering Magician Armor&r but lacks the growth potential of the &dMagical Robes&r."]
	quest.2EC5F8A4C45BE431.quest_subtitle: "Found using a Mysterious Orb"
	quest.2F355F4D8D0BA695.quest_desc: [
		"As you progress, you may need to start producing energy to power your machines and tools. Here's some mods that focus on power generation and transfer"
		""
		"&b&lDyson Cube Project&r&r"
		"Build massive energy systems that harvest and store power on a planetary scale."
		""
		"&c&lPowah&r&r"
		"Generate, store, and move energy with compact machines that scale cleanly through each tier."
		""
		"&l&#1F6E37Flux Networks&r&r"
		"Create wireless power networks to move energy across your base, dimensions, and machines."
		""
		"&l&eExtreme Reactors&r&r"
		"Build large multiblock reactors to produce serious power for demanding tech setups."
	]
	quest.2F355F4D8D0BA695.quest_subtitle: "Unlimited Power!"
	quest.2F355F4D8D0BA695.title: "Intro to Power"
	quest.2F4D2CB8EA72FF22.title: "Stack of Dye"
	quest.300AE318B1A851E1.quest_desc: [
		"Increased &bSpell Damage&r for &dAir Spells&r."
		""
		"Attacks inflict extra knockback, and the wearer gets a speed boost."
	]
	quest.300B3090E03A3167.quest_desc: [
		"&dAlteration Table&r is used to inscribe &bUpgrade Threads&r onto magical armors. "
		""
		"To use the table, place armor onto the stand of the table. The tablet will display the available Thread Slots on the armor. "
		""
		"To add or a thread, use the thread on the tablet of the table. Removing the armor will apply the threads to the armor."
		""
		"To remove a thread, place the armor on the table and interact with the display with an empty hand."
	]
	quest.3049513645E51A2C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cleric Familiar&r"
		""
		"&bBattle:&r specialized in holy magic, their main role is supporting but they can also cast powerful holy spells to purify enemies."
		""
		"&bAbilities:&r"
		"&aSalvation:&r They will attack the undead on sight, but if they see a Zombie Villager, they will use their holy power to cure them and grant them the salvation."
		""
		"&bSpawn:&r To get a cleric familiar, you will need to cast the cleanse spell near an untamed necromancer familiar."
		""
		"&bFood:&r can be healed using divine pearls."
	]
	quest.3049513645E51A2C.title: "Tame a Cleric"
	quest.3054F4299F5207A8.title: "The Monk"
	quest.30C98C20F4EE63B1.quest_subtitle: "Apothecarist"
	quest.30C98C20F4EE63B1.title: "Mangrove Hut"
	quest.312ABA9C01F2CB6B.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Replicator&r can create items from the matter in your &dMatter Network&r."
		""
		"You can put an item in manually to be replicated, but once you have a &aReplication Terminal&r you will be able to request saved items to be created with all &6Replicators&r connected to your &dMatter Network&r."
		""
		"A &6Replicator&r does not have any speed upgrade, so for faster operations you'll want many &6Replicators&r in your &dMatter Network&r."
	]
	quest.31534A35763E7E4D.title: "Oritech"
	quest.318E4F92A06C24A2.quest_desc: ["&dTotem of Undying&r for your familiars"]
	quest.3195CC7867A874D0.quest_desc: [
		"The &6EM Rail Injector Controller&r!"
		""
		"It is used to launch &dBeams&r and &bSolar Sails&r at the sun to form your &eDyson Cube&r."
		""
		"A &6Rail Injector&r does not need power to operate, but powering it will make it shoot more &dBeams&r or &aSolar Sails&r per shot."
		"You can input power into the center of the bottom face."
		""
		"The &6Rail Injector&r needs direct line of sight with the sun."
		""
		"It &c&lwill not&r&r operate during night, storms, or midday while the sun is too high (it cant shoot straight up)"
	]
	quest.31B1E68EBF2326EA.title: "The Sorcerer"
	quest.31E28342EE504F04.quest_subtitle: "32 Armor"
	quest.31E28342EE504F04.title: "Ignitium Armor"
	quest.324687F5C193025B.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Enchanter's Horn&r will cast the inscribed spell as a &dSelf&r &eAOE&r with &eExtend Duration&r (If you fully charge the horn before casting)."
		""
		"When inscribing a spell, do not give the spell a form it will be added automatically."
	]
	quest.326ED8BA53D95740.quest_desc: [
		"Right-click a tamed familiar to boost their armor permanently"
		""
		"Limit 10 per familiar"
		""
		"Dropped from &aAncient Knights&r."
	]
	quest.326ED8BA53D95740.quest_subtitle: "More Armor"
	quest.332446AEF84C59A7.quest_desc: [
		"To harness the power of a storm and obtain the &6Rod o' Lightning&r you'll need 3 things:"
		"   "
		"- &aEnergized Core&r"
		"- &eLightning Rod&r"
		"- &dThunder&r"
		""
		"During a &dThunderstorm&r, place down the &eLightning Rod&r in view of the sky. Use the &aEnergized Core&r on the &eLightning Rod&r."
	]
	quest.33C338C36621F231.quest_desc: [
		"&6&lIron Jetpacks&r&r"
		"Craft and upgrade powered jetpacks to take flight, improve mobility, and make vertical travel much easier."
	]
	quest.33C338C36621F231.title: "Iron Jetpacks"
	quest.3483E1BA50713233.title: "Diplomacy’s great — but have you tried a bigger sword?"
	quest.34A1C1ABB329685B.quest_desc: [
		"To save an item to your &eMatter Network&r for replication you will need 3 things:"
		""
		"1. &aMemory Chip&r - Can store 16 items!"
		""
		"2. &6Identification Chamber&r - Place a &aMemory Chip&r and the item you want to store. The item will be consumed and saved onto the &aMemory Chip&r."
		""
		"3. &dChip Storage&r - Can store 8 &aMemory Chips&r for a total of 128 items!"
		""
		"To replicate items saved on your Matter Network you will need one final piece, &bReplication Terminal&r!"
	]
	quest.34A1C1ABB329685B.title: "Storing Recipes"
	quest.34CFCE24D06CE08D.quest_subtitle: "26 Armor"
	quest.34CFCE24D06CE08D.title: "Tertium Armor"
	quest.34DAF6B63877CD02.title: "Mekanism"
	quest.34EEC27FAD094020.quest_subtitle: "Hero of the Village"
	quest.34EEC27FAD094020.title: "Wild"
	quest.352B592A2572FDBD.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Inventory Configurator&r can be used to add &bItem Filters&r to blocks."
		""
		"Blocks can be connected with the &6Inventory Configurator&r so that they share the filter properties of the block they are linked to."
	]
	quest.357C7D2A5E90281B.quest_desc: [
		"&nSummoning:&r"
		""
		"To summon a &dStarbuncle&r, use a &bStarbuncle Charm&r on the ground."
		""
		"Summoned &dStarbuncles&r will pickup nearby items and can move items between inventories such as chests."
		""
		"&dStarbuncles&r will harvest fully grown &9Source Berry&r bushes around it."
		""
		"A &dStarbuncle&r will drop its charm when &bDispelled&r or when killed."
		""
		"&dStarbuncles&r may dyed any color."
		""
		"&nItem Transport:&r"
		""
		"To bind a &dStarbuncle&r to place items into a chest, use the &6Dominion Wand&r on the Starbuncle and then the inventory."
		""
		"To take items from an inventory, use the &6Dominion Wand&r on the inventory and then the &dStarbuncle&r."
		""
		"&dStarbuncles&r will move items between as many inventories as you desire."
		""
		"Using the &6Dominion Wand&r on a &dStarbuncle&r while sneaking will reset them."
		""
		"&nFiltering:&r"
		""
		"You may dictate where items go and may be picked up by using &aItem Scrolls&r or &aItem Frames&r. "
		""
		"A &dStarbuncle&r may be given an &aItem Scroll: Allow&r or &aDeny&r, and will only pickup and move items respecting that filter. "
		""
		"Alternatively, you may place an &aItem Frame&r on the inventory a &dStarbuncle&r is interacting with. You may either place an &aItem Scroll&r or a single item directly on the frame. &dStarbuncle&r interacting with that inventory will respect item framed filters."
	]
	quest.357C7D2A5E90281B.quest_subtitle: "Magic Little Mailman"
	quest.357C7D2A5E90281B.title: "Starbuncle Mail Service"
	quest.3580128FE600742E.quest_desc: ["The &6Starter Bundle&r is available in the &aShop&r and includes everything you need to start &dDoggy Talent Next&r!"]
	quest.35D71B1EE7C043DC.quest_desc: [
		"&dBelt of Levitation&r allows the user to levitate a moderate distance above the ground. Useful for climbing mountains!"
		"Sneak in the air while falling (or jumping) to rise."
		""
		"Reduces a small amount of fall damage."
	]
	quest.35D71B1EE7C043DC.quest_subtitle: "Shake it like a polaroid picture"
	quest.35EEEBF5254606C7.quest_desc: ["&6Explorer's Compass&r can find any structure within a 10,000 block radius."]
	quest.35EEEBF5254606C7.quest_subtitle: "Find Any Structure!"
	quest.360C5B99FA9EFE7F.quest_desc: [
		"Summoned &aWhirlisprigs&r can be given a home in the world, and will begin producing natural materials including wood, crops, seeds, and flowers that exist around them."
		""
		"Wild &aWhirlisprigs&r will drop &bWhirlisprig Tokens&r if a tree is grown near them."
		""
		"They may be dyed given &6orange&r, &eyellow&r, white, or &agreen&r."
		""
		"&nSummoning:&r"
		""
		"To summon a &aWhirlisprig&r, use a &bWhirlisprig Charm&r on any flower."
		""
		"&aWhirlisprigs&r consider their home to be 10 blocks in any direction from the flower."
		""
		"&aWhirlisprigs&r require source nearby to operate, and will only generate items if there is a &eChest&r placed next to the flower. "
		""
		"You can get your charm back by using &bDispel&r on a &aWhirlisprig&r."
		""
		"&nHappiness:&r"
		""
		"Summoned &aWhirlisprigs&r must be happy in order to produce materials, and their mood is determined by the number and diversity of natural materials in their home."
		""
		"You may use blocks on the &aWhirlisprig&r to gain additional info if a &aWhirlisprig&r would enjoy that block in their home. "
		""
		"Interacting with the &aWhirlisprig&r with an empty hand will give you additional info on the &aWhirlisprig's&r happiness."
		""
		"&nProduction:&r"
		""
		"Drop rates are determined by happiness, diversity, and the proportions of blocks in a &aWhirlisprig&r home."
		""
		"For example, to generate a lot of logs, grow more trees. To gain more seeds and crop harvests, plant more crops."
	]
	quest.360C5B99FA9EFE7F.quest_subtitle: "Auto-Harvest"
	quest.362FA68330008D97.quest_desc: [
		"There's many mods available to assist with production, processing, and automation"
		""
		"&#d4af37&lCreate&r&r"
		"Build moving machines, automated contraptions, and production lines powered by rotation."
		""
		"&l&dMekanism&r&r"
		"Progress through advanced machines, ore processing, power generation, and high-tech equipment."
		""
		"&6&lOritech&r&r"
		"Use modern machines and energy systems to process resources, automate production, and upgrade your tools."
		""
		"&l&aIndustrial Foregoing&r&r"
		"Automate farming, mob processing, resource collection, and other useful base tasks."
		""
		"&l&bJust Dire Things&r&r"
		"Craft strange tools, gadgets, and machines that open up new ways to explore, fight, and automate."
	]
