	quest.376D133C25DE7EA3.quest_desc: [
		"While equipped, the glyph of this school will be amplified and discounted."
		""
		"As a drawback, the lesser focus will weaken glyphs of other elemental schools."
		""
		"This focus empowers &cIgnite&r to inflict &6Magic Burn&r. This effect allows &cFlare&r to inflict damage and spread even on fire resistant mobs and let magic pierce through part of the enemy armor, but will also make earth damage less effective."
		""
		"&aSummon Steed&r will be changed to summon a rideable &cStrider&r."
		""
		"&cIgnite&r + &cEvaporate&r will combo together to destroy &bIce&r blocks."
	]
	quest.376D133C25DE7EA3.quest_subtitle: "Fire Bender"
	quest.37AA0F3518CEF07D.quest_desc: ["&6Item Filter&r has 9 slots for items/blocks to be set as Whitelist or Blacklist."]
	quest.37B0DFAEEF25DE4F.quest_desc: ["&dEnchanted Spell Turrets&r cast spells at half the &9Source&r cost compared to &bBasic Spell Turrets&r."]
	quest.37DB208EDA65F54B.title: "+1 Ring Slot"
	quest.3841059E2D2D8D73.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Replication Terminal&r shows you how much matter of each type is stored in your &aMatter Network&r, how many times you can replicate stored items, and contains the &dMatterOpedia&r!"
		""
		"The &dMatterOpedia&r is a cataloge of every item that can be disintegrated/replicated using matter. Using the guide can show you special ways of searching the &dMatterOpedia&r for specific conditions."
		""
		"When requesting items to be replicated from the &6Replication Terminal&r it will use all &9Replicators&r found in your &aMatter Network&r in tandem and return the items to a small inventory within the &6Replication Terminal&r."
	]
