		"To use the &dEnchanting Apparatus&r, place any number of &bArcane Pedestals&r within 3 blocks with their items. Once you have filled the pedestals, use the catalyst item on the &dEnchanting Apparatus&r and make sure you provide enough &9Source.&r"
