		"&dSource Relay: Depositor&r will send &9Source&r to any available block up to 5 blocks away and take from 1 target block set with a &eDominion Wand&r."
		""
		"You can use a &eDominion Wand&r to prevent the &dSource Relay: Depositor&r from sending to a single nearby block by setting the &dSource Relay: Depositor&r to 'Send' to the block you don't want it to send &9Source&r. Counter intuitive, I know. &dThe Source Relay: Depositor&r will send to every available block without linking any 'Send' targets, so think of it more as blacklisted or 'Dont Send'."
