	quest.57355B669AFB7600.quest_desc: [
		"&6Inventory Proxy&r acts as an extension to the side of the block it is facing."
		""
		"&n&aExample:&r&r"
		"A block like the &bFurnace&r accepts fuel in the top face of the block."
		""
		"Normally you could set up a chain of &aHoppers&r or pipes into that single side, but with an &6Inventory Proxy&r you get 5 more block faces you can input from."
		"{image:kubejs:item/tss1 width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.5763075F173B561D.quest_desc: [
		"The goal of &6Beyond&r is to guide players through mods regardless of experience so they can have a thorough understanding without searching tons of Wiki's and Reddit post."
		""
		"&dMastery Badges&r are a symbol of that understanding proving a player's knowledge."
		""
		"I'm no artist, so the Icons for these badges are a work-in-progress."
		""
		"If you are an artist and interested in supporting the modpack contact me on the BeetleKnight Discord"
	]
