	quest.5CCB3E78D6580C18.quest_desc: [
		"While equipped, the glyph of this school will be amplified and discounted."
		""
		"As a drawback, the lesser focus will weaken glyphs of other elemental schools."
		""
		"This focus empowers &aPoison Spores&r and &aGrow&r, dealing damage to undead with a chance of spawning a &2Spore Blossom&r."
		""
		"&9Gravity&r + &eSensitive&r combos to create a gravity field that pulls entities towards its center."
		""
		"Grants knockback resistance and boosts natural and instant healing by 1.5."
	]
	quest.5CCB3E78D6580C18.quest_subtitle: "Earth Bender"
	quest.5CD5BFF3BE675E0B.title: "Ferricore Armor"
	quest.5D4357DCD58FE8C4.quest_desc: [
		"While equipped, &cFocus of Fire&r grants &bAmplify&r and discounts the casting cost for glyphs of this school."
		""
		"&cFocus of Fire&r also grants &bSpell Damage II&r while the wearer is on fire or in lava."
		""
		"Unlike a lesser focus, a major focus will not weaken glyphs of other elemental schools."
	]
	quest.5D9B77629260CCE8.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Patrol Path Recorder&r can be used to set a path for a golem in &ePatrol&r mode."
		""
		"For a golem to be assigned the path you will need a &dCommand Wand&r or &aConfig Card&r"
		""
		"&dCommand Wand&r - You open a golem's curio and insert the &6Patrol Path Recorder&r"
		""
		"&aConfig Card&r - You copy the &6Patrol Path Recorder&r into the path config and every golem given the &aConfig Card&r will have the path saved."
	]
	quest.5E4D29C6227504EA.title: "Honey Glue"
	quest.5E686E762AA2C0C7.quest_desc: [
		"While equipped, &2Focus of Necromancy&5&r grants &bAmplify&r and discounts the casting cost for glyphs of the anima school."
		""
		"Summoned &aWolves&r, &aUndead,&r and &aVexes&r will rise from death stronger. These undead summons will mirror any &bHoming&r spells you cast and heal you whenever they kill an enemy."
	]
	quest.5E93797A9E5FDF27.quest_desc: [
		"Congratulations on creating your first &6Humanoid Golem&r!"
		""
		"&6Humanoid Golems&r can equip nearly anything a player can."
		""
		"&6Humanoid Golems&r can be given a &aZombie/Skeleton/Wither Skeleton Skull&r named as a player to copy their skin, but you will need a &dCommand Wand/Omnipotent Wand&r to access the Golem's Curio menu and equip the skull in the &eHumanoid Golem Skin&r slot."
	]
