	quest.6051E173A5CB7C36.quest_desc: [
		"To get started with &6Applied Energistics 2&r, find a meteorite. These are fairly common and tend to leave massive holes in the terrain."
		""
		"Once you have found a meteorite, mine into its center. You will find certus quartz clusters, certus quartz buds, budding certus blocks of various types, and a &aMysterious Cube&r in the center."
		""
		"Mine the certus quartz clusters and any certus quartz blocks you find. You can also pick up the budding certus blocks, but without silk touch they will degrade by 1 tier."
		""
		"&c&nDo not break&r&r any &dFlawless Budding Certus&r, as even with silk touch they will degrade to flawed budding certus."
		""
		"Also mine the &aMysterious Cube&r in the center of the meteorite to gain all 4 inscriber presses."
	]
	quest.6051E173A5CB7C36.quest_subtitle: "It can't be that complicated, right?"
	quest.6051E173A5CB7C36.title: "Applied Energistics 2"
	quest.60B6638F4537B7C3.quest_subtitle: "Netherite is just the begining. With Advanced Netherite you can push the limits of your gear and get special traits"
	quest.60F1847F2B3FF4D6.title: "+1 Curio Slot"
