	quest.623380751FF4658A.quest_desc: [
		"There's many mods available for all your resource production needs:"
		""
		"&e&lProductive Bees&r&r"
		"Breed and manage bees to produce useful resources over time."
		""
		"&l&cRoost Ultimate&r&r"
		"Raise resource chickens and collect materials from their roosts."
		""
		"&#8B4513&lMoo Fluids&r&r"
		"Find and farm fluid cows to gather liquids in a more renewable way."
		""
		"&l&dMob Grinding Utils&r&r"
		"Build controlled mob farms to collect drops, experience, and other useful resources."
		""
		"&l&bHostile Neural Networks&r&r"
		"Train data models from mobs, then use them to generate drops without constant combat."
		""
		"&l&aReplication&r&r"
		"Turn matter into the resources you need through scanning, storage, and replication."
	]
