		"&6Cornelius&r is a master of coins and dealer of dark arts."
		""
		"To tame &6Cornelius&r a bee must be slain in his prescence."
		""
		"Once tamed, &6Cornelius&r can be given coins which he uses to summon creatures to fight for him. You can also bet your coins with him in a game of &cBlackjack&r!"
