	quest.64C2C35C8BE39D89.quest_desc: [
		"&dWarp Scroll&r will teleport the player, as long as they are in the same dimension, to the location saved onto the scroll consuming the &dWarp Scroll&r."
		""
		"&dWarp Scrolls&r can also be used to make a &bWarp Portal&r. Make a frame out of nearly any source block, horizontal or vertical, and toss a &dWarp Scroll&r into the frame. The &bWarp Portal&r requires a full &eSource Jar&r nearby to ignite."
		""
		"&bWarp Portal&r texture can be switched between &eEnd Portal&r and &eNether Portal&r with a &6Dominion Wand&r."
		""
		"&cWarning:&r Portal texture may not render with some shaders."
	]
