		"The &6Gohei&r is a normal melee weapon."
		""
		"A &dMaid&r holding a &6Gohei&r will shoot &aDanmaku&r while on the &aDanmaku&r task."
	]
	quest.6895C588FBC6E9D9.title: "Craft a Gohei"
	quest.68BCAF4837AACC9E.quest_desc: [
		"&6&lJust Hammers&r&r"
		"Hammers mine larger areas at once, making tunnels, resource gathering, and big digging projects much faster."
	]
	quest.68BCAF4837AACC9E.quest_subtitle: "The square hole specialist"
	quest.68BCAF4837AACC9E.title: "Just Hammers"
	quest.692C9A4132879FBB.quest_desc: [
		"&dRepository Catalogs&r can insert and extract items from any adjacent and connected &eRepository&r."
		""
		"Catalogs respect filters placed on repositories via item frames while inserting items, and will prioritize existing stacks of an item."
		""
		"&aFilter Scrolls&r can be used on the Catalog, storing the filter and applying it to all connected repositories when interacted with directly."
		""
		"&dRepository Catalogs&r are highly performant when used with the &6Storage Lectern&r and should be used over other big inventories or systems with many slots."
		""
		"Filters are not applied when items are extracted from other systems like a &eHopper&r, and insertions via &eHopper&r will not respect the &dRepository Catalog's&r own filter, but will respect inserting into a filtered &eRepository&r."
	]
	quest.695DEF795AC23A87.title: "Tier 4 Seeds"
	quest.6968B5899A403C24.quest_desc: [
		"If it can be burned in a furnace it can be converted into &9Source&r with the &dVolcanic Sourcelink&r. "
		"More burn time = more &9Source&r. "
		"&5Archwood Logs&r can be burned for bonus &9Source&r, &4Blazing Archwood Logs&r provide the most bonus."
		""
		"To compare:"
		"64x &4Blazing Archwood Logs&r fill a &bSource Jar&r 80%"
		"64x &2Oak Logs&r fill a &bSource Jar&r 16%"
	]
	quest.6968B5899A403C24.quest_subtitle: "Turn Fuel into Source"
	quest.6970A8BF31F69BF0.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Metal Golem&r requires a &aMetal Golem Body&r, &e2&r &aArms&r, and &aLegs&r"
		""
		"Before you can slap these parts together you will need to give them a material. Put the &aGolem Parts&r in an &bAnvil&r with the material you want to use. "
		""
		""
		"&aMetal Golem Body&r - 9 Ingots"
		"&aMetal Golem Arms&r - 9 Ingots"
		"&aMetal Golem Legs&r - 9 Ingots"
		""
		""
		"&c&nNote:&r&r You can check JEI for compatible materials and their various bonuses."
	]
	quest.6970A8BF31F69BF0.title: "Metal Golem"
	quest.697B7A9638CE39B5.title: "Intro to Fargo's Talismans"
	quest.69F9CC171F644284.quest_subtitle: "That's a lot of Mana"
	quest.6A2F5072A0F5D2D9.quest_desc: [
		"&l&6Better Combat&r&r"
		"Makes combat smooth with new animations and mechanics. Holding the attack button will continuosly swing your weapon on cooldown. You can also dual wield weapons for increased attack speed"
		""
		"&l&aCombat Roll&r&r"
		"Allows you to roll (imagine that!). The default keybind is \"R\". During a roll you get invinsibility frames (aka I-frames) so you can dodge through attacks with a carefully timed roll (This can be changed in config) "
	]
	quest.6A2F5072A0F5D2D9.quest_subtitle: "Better Combat and Combat Roll"
	quest.6A2F5072A0F5D2D9.title: "Better Combat Roll"
