	quest.6CE121FBCC12B913.quest_desc: [
		"Fluix is one of the primary ingredients for AE2 blocks, devices, and items."
		""
		"Made by throwing &7Nether Quartz&r, &cRedstone&r, and &bCharged Certus Quartz&r in water."
