		"The &aDTN Dog&r should be in the ame dimension as the owner or bed."
	]
	quest.6D9BB5A78310948D.quest_desc: ["The &6Retrieval Wand&r returns all golems to your inventory when you Right-Click or returns whichever golem you are looking at if you Shift Right-Click"]
	quest.6DBF7C2703CB3634.quest_desc: [
		"Matter Tanks can hold 256,000 matter of a single type! "
		""
		"There are 8 types of matter -"
		""
		"&2Earth&r - Dirt, Stone, Sand"
		"&6Organic&r - Grass, Leaves, Mob Heads"
		"&dLiving&r - Feather, Bone, Rotten Flesh"
		"&7Metallic&r - Iron, Nickel, Lead"
		"&ePrecious&r - Diamond, Emerald, Gold"
		"&cNether&r - Netherack, Blaze Rod, Netherite Scrap"
		"&3Ender&r - Ender Pearl, End Rod, End Crystal"
		"&5Quantum&r - Dragons Breath, Skulk, Nether Star"
	]
	quest.6DFDD820D7444425.quest_subtitle: "Removes the affix from an item's name "
	quest.6E15A2D032A2A1E4.title: "Modular Golem: +1 Upgrade Slot"
	quest.6E899B74CEDE6245.title: "Netherite-Emerald Armor"
	quest.6EB446735D8328CE.title: "Everlasting Beef"
	quest.6F4D1427FB6BAD02.quest_desc: ["&aVibranium&r can be found high in The Nether or in the caves of The Other. Like &eAllthemodium&r it will always be exposed to air."]
	quest.6F56AB3375DD4023.quest_desc: ["&dMarisa's Broom&r is a VERY fast flying vehicle that only requires a &6Maid&r passenger to function."]
