		""
		"To inscribe an item, place on the &bScribes Table&r and use blocks and items on the table while sneaking. "
		""
		"When given to a &aStarbuncle&r, the &aStarbuncle&r will only pickup and take items on the scroll."
	]
	quest.711BC714147A4A6B.quest_subtitle: "Whitelist Filter"
	quest.7203CC9CC6063790.quest_desc: ["Applies 2x &bAmplify Glyph's&r to the &6Enchanter's Bow&r or &6Enchanter's Crossbow's&r inscribed spell."]
	quest.72179A1A14C05CD4.title: "Summit"
	quest.72E093B659B673E4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Banks&r are a compact method of storing a TON of items with options to void overflow."
		""
		"While holding your &6Bank&r, Shift-Right Click to toggle modes; Bag, Build, and Randomized Build."
		""
		"While holding your &6Bank&r in build mode, hold Shift and scroll to change which block you want to place."
	]
	quest.72E093B659B673E4.title: "Banks"
	quest.72E15637323F60AA.quest_desc: [
		"The &dStorage Lectern&r can used to view, manage, and craft from multiple connected inventories. "
		""
		"The number of inventories that may be connected is determined by the number of &9Bookwyrms&r bound to the lectern. You can add more &9Bookwyrms&r to the lectern by using a &aBookwyrm Charm&r."
		""
		"Use the &6Dominion Wand&r from an inventory to the lectern in order to bind or remove access. Inventories can be connected 30 blocks away."
		""
		"Items can be automatically inserted into the &dStorage Lectern&r by placing them into an unbound inventory adjacent to the lectern."
		""
		"&nLinking Lecturns:&r"
		""
		"You may also link a &dStorage Lectern&r to the 'main' lectern in order to extend the view and access of the original lectern, these lecterns can be chained together within 30 blocks indefinitely."
		""
		"Once a &dStorage Lectern&r is linked to another lectern, it will no longer be able to connect to inventories or accept &9Bookwyrms&r."
		""
		"A linked &dStorage Lectern&r can only connect inventories that are adjacent to the lectern. A &eRepository Catalog&r can be used to connect &eRepositories&r for more storage space."
		""
		"&nStorage Tabs:&r"
		""
		"Linked inventories that are named will create a tab in the &dStorage Lectern&r, allowing you to view and manipulate all inventories that share that name."
		""
		"Unlike normal chests, &eRepositories&r will preserve their name when dropped. The &bName Glyph&r can also name inventories placed in the world."
	]
	quest.72E15637323F60AA.quest_subtitle: "Magic Inventory Terminal"
	quest.73045AD2BD66897E.quest_desc: ["Found in Priest Towers in Villages"]
	quest.7338F80BD0156A39.quest_desc: [
		"Arrange the blocks as seen in the image below:"
		"{image:kubejs:item/forbiddenarcanus1 width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Place your &bDarkstone Pedestals&r and &bSmithing Table&r. When you have everything in place activate the forge by using &bMundabitar&r &bDust&r on the &bSmithing Table&r"
		"{image:kubejs:item/forbiddenarcanus2 width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7338F80BD0156A39.title: "Building The Forge"
	quest.739166CDC3886D13.title: "+1 Belt Slot"
	quest.73B4D7C665032F40.quest_desc: [
		"Increased &bSpell Damage&r for &dSummoning Spells&r."
		""
		"The wearer's summons target whatever the user attacks with increased damage."
	]
	quest.73E1B57A692A99DC.quest_desc: [
		"&9Source&r the fuel that makes many of the magical processes and automation in &eArs Nouveau&r function."
		""
		"&dSource Jars&r store &9Source&r generated from nearby &bSourcelinks&r. Check the quest above to see the various &bSourcelinks&r and how they generate &9Source&r."
		""
		"&aSource Relays&r are used to transfer &9Source&r (check the quest below), but you'll need a &6Dominion Wand&r before you can start dictating where &9Source&r is being sent."
	]
