	quest.7A6AEDB31123F492.quest_desc: [
		"I'll be honest, the &6Wireless Terminal&r is kinda useless (sorry tom)."
		""
		"While holding the &6Wireless Terminal&r you get extended reach, 16 blocks, to open your &aStorage/Crafting Terminal&r."
		""
